{
  "name": "h8_sqd_explore",
  "description": "H8: the optimised LUCJ samples only ~155 distinct determinants at 10k shots (subspace 36-41%, 1.5-2.1 kcal/mol). Two fixes at the same total budget: (a) just more shots, 30k/100k; (b) give 25%/50% of the shots to a random-parameter exploration circuit (scale 0.3 or 1.0). Optimised circuit is cached, so ~1 min per run. --out $B/h8_smoke.",
